    {
      "record_id": "T-UNSTATED",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：给每个选项找一句原文依据",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.verbal.detail_inference.textual_support"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-UNSTATED"
      ],
      "independence_group": "detail-support-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "draft_unreviewed",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-UNSTATED"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "选项中的每个关键关系都要能在原文找到对应句。原文只说“继续观察”，就没有比较其他植物；没有比较，就不能补出“更易成活”。",
      "record_sha256": "6f51908fbbb8a464496cbddb119c226379bbece5cb79dfc8417587e42add4567"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-SCOPE",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：量词和地点是推断的边界",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.verbal.detail_inference.scope"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-SCOPE"
      ],
      "independence_group": "detail-scope-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "draft_unreviewed",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-SCOPE"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "把“两处背阴空地”“相似条件”等限定词标出来。局部记录能支持局部表述，不能自动换成“所有社区空地”或任何不同条件。",
      "record_sha256": "ba6cab6e2733388d427b9ae86ffe002027a55502108a83353ce47bbce0c95935"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-CAUSE",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：同时出现不等于单一原因",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.verbal.detail_inference.causality"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-CAUSE"
      ],
      "independence_group": "detail-cause-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "draft_unreviewed",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-CAUSE"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "看到两个变化和一个结果同时出现，只能先说它们共同出现。若文本没有比较、控制或明确因果说明，不能把其中一项写成“唯一原因”或“必然导致”。",
      "record_sha256": "85502bd25659ae2f35566e8560c73ffc9ebc54efe32ed5cf6c51b2721210d101"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-ABS",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：把“必然、所有、唯一”逐个核对",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.verbal.detail_inference.strength"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-ABS"
      ],
      "independence_group": "detail-strength-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "draft_unreviewed",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-ABS"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "强词需要强证据。原文只报告一次观察或保留判断时，出现“必然”“所有”“唯一”的选项通常已经超过了文本允许的力度。",
      "record_sha256": "09b2acb5ad9e7e4e9e190dd069f30c96cbbd8e6a1736e3f94bfdb8b1503a18d3"
    },
